the realm  do you know what the realm is  it's the thousand blades of aegon's  enemies  a story we agreed to tell each other  over  and over till we forget that it's a lie  what's up ladies and gentlemen welcome  back for another game of thrones house  of the dragon video well my friends it  looks like we finally have another  official wins of winner and house of the  dragon update from george rr martin's  not a blog website  it honestly seems like it has been a  while since we've received any new  information about the show as you all  know we are now less than four months  away from finally getting to see the  first episode of house of the dragon  hbo's new series set roughly 170 years  before the events of game of thrones and  a song of ice and fire now before we go  any further let's go over to george r  martin's website so we can see what he  had to say only a few hours ago as  always george says there is a lot going  on good things bad things big things and  small things there's no time for a long  blog just now but here are a few random  comments about all and sundry some of  which may interest some of you it looks  like the jets and giants both did very  well in the first round of the nfl draft  well i'm gonna go ahead and skip this  section of the blog i doubt any of us  are here for his thoughts on football it  goes on to say dark winds debuts in june  on amc the trailer is everywhere so  check it out if you have not seen it yet  i was one of the executive producers on  the show a six-episode adaptation of the  navajo detective novels by the late  great tony hillerman now as interesting  as this may sound i don't think any of  us are here for this either i'm sorry  george we all love you but we're all  here for one thing and one thing only he  says the winds of winter is going to be  a big book the way it's going it could  be bigger than a storm of swords or a  dance with dragons the longest books in  the series to date i do usually cut and  trim once i finish but i need to finish  first alright folks now let me just say  something about this and i will be the  first to admit maybe i am foolish for  thinking this but i have to believe that  at least george rr martin believes he  will get the wins of winner done  relatively soon i just don't see any  other reason why he would continue  reminding us about how often he is  working on it unless he feels like he's  almost done with it he knows better than  anyone else that whenever he mentions  the wins of winner he will receive a lot  of backlash for not having it finished  over the last decade if he actually knew  he would never get it done i don't see a  reason for him to mention it knowing  what kind of criticism it brings every  single time  now i know i know i go back and forth on  this myself  my thoughts and feelings about the winds  of winter flips with every single update  he blogs about but like i said at the  end of the day i just have to believe he  knows he's nearly finished otherwise i  don't see why he would always remind us  about it unless he's just downright evil  which i don't think he is  now that he's letting us know how big he  thinks it will be makes me think he's  obviously already written more than  enough to know then again who really  knows maybe he is just saying it will be  the biggest novel so he can excuse  himself for taking so long  either way i do want to stay optimistic  about this  deep down i do feel like he will get it  done sometime soon now let's see what  else he said  he goes on to say i saw rough cuts of a  couple more episodes of house of the  dragon and was just as happy as i was  with the earlier episodes ryan and  miguel and their cast and crew are doing  great work those of you who like complex  conflicted and grey characters as i do  will like the series there will be more  than enough dragons and battles to be  sure but the spine of the story is the  human conflicts the love and the hate it  will be more of a character drama rather  than an action-adventure story it will  obviously be a lot like game of thrones  only the story will not be as grand it  should be mostly contained to a few  locations like king's landing and  dragonstone unlike game of thrones where  we were constantly bouncing around from  different locations all over westeros  and essos now i do like that house of  the dragon will be more focused on the  central story but i will also miss that  adventure aspect that game of thrones  did so well  now i like battle scenes as much as the  next guy but some of my favorite moments  on game of thrones were when things were  more intimate moments when we would see  characters getting to know each other  like arya and the hound jon and egret  tyrion and braun or even bran jojen and  mira  under almost any other circumstances you  would never see these characters hanging  out with each other but because of the  situations they were in they had to lean  on each other and depend on one another  for survival  characters who at first may seem like  the odd couple but through hardships and  adversity they would form bonds with  each other that would draw them closer  than some of their own relationships  with family it's amazing moments like  these that will be missed from house of  the dragon but that doesn't mean the new  series won't make up for it in other  ways i am very anxious and excited to  see how the first season will unfold  like i said at the beginning of the  video we are now less than only four  months away from seeing that first  episode and according to george rr  martin the episodes were very well done  just like i did with the game of thrones  episodes i will start working on my  house of the dragon episode breakdown  videos immediately after each new  episode ends i'm hoping that i will see  all of you back here for those videos  when we can finally have something new  to dive into and discuss and dissect  as always make sure you are subscribed  now that way you will know whenever i  release a new video regarding anything  about game of thrones house of the  dragon the winds of winter or a song of  ice and fire i want to thank all of you  for stopping by and checking out this  short update video i hope all of you  have a great day i will see you again  very soon  bye  you

